# PR messages (HW3)

When the user wants a PR title or body for work that includes `homework-3/`:

1. Read and follow the **pr-messages** skill at `homework-3/.cursor/skills/pr-messages/SKILL.md`.
2. Resolve base branch, then `git diff <branch>...HEAD` and `git log <branch>...HEAD --oneline`.
3. For spec-only PRs, **How to check** should cite doc review steps (link integrity, Appendix B checklist) not fictional `npm test` unless code exists.
4. Do not open the PR unless the user explicitly asks.
